      <div class="case-cell room-bedroom"></div>
    </div>
    <p class="board-caption">The solved case: M = Mochi (killer), T = Tofu, P = Pixel.</p>

    <h3>Step 5: Look at the Victim's Room</h3>

    <p><span class="step-tag">5</span>The Kitchen holds the victim and exactly one other suspect: Mochi. That is the governing rule of every case, and it names the killer. <strong>Mochi ambushed Old Whiskers.</strong> Every statement checks out, every row and column holds exactly one figure, and because every placement was forced, the solution is provably unique. That is the whole game: rules constrain, clues resolve, and the victim's room accuses.</p>

